==Tày==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tyz|tai-pro|*ʔaːnᴮ||to [[recite]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|nod|ᩋ᩵ᩣ᩠ᨶ}}, {{cog|lo|ອ່ານ}}, {{cog|blt|ꪮ꪿ꪱꪙ}}, {{cog|khb|ᦀᦱᧃᧈ}}, {{cog|shn|ဢၢၼ်ႇ}}, {{cog|aho|𑜒𑜃𑜫}}, {{cog|th|อ่าน}}. Compare {{cog|km|អាន}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{tyz-IPA}}

===Verb===
{{tyz-verb|[[按]]; [[案]]}}

# to [[count]] (one by one); to [[number]]; to [[enumerate]]
#: {{ux|tyz|Mí chắc kỉ lai, '''án''' còi.|Dunno how much, you go '''count'''.}}
#: {{ux|tyz|Nòn phồm '''án''' vài, nòn ngai '''án''' khẩu|Lie prone to '''count''' the buffaloes, lie supine to '''count''' the grains}}

